    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1685115569\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1685115569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1685115569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/463dafef5c50a4cf714d8a8f764483ab.avif?t=1685115569\" /></span><br><strong>The story is about fears and the past that can sit inside us, in our subconscious, and resurface at the most unusual moments.<br>Fear, friendship, hallucinations that mingle with reality...</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/d1fb5da7c617d6e8f3edd40683ece1a1.avif?t=1685115569\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An intriguing story with charismatic characters.<br></li><li>Inimitable and everyone's favorite retro atmosphere.<br></li><li>Unusual audio solutions will make you experience unforgettable emotions.<br></li><li>Several unique endings.</li></ul><br><strong>Stay tuned and join our discord channel!</strong><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1685115569\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1685115569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1685115569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/463dafef5c50a4cf714d8a8f764483ab.avif?t=1685115569\" /></span><br><strong>The story is about fears and the past that can sit inside us, in our subconscious, and resurface at the most unusual moments.<br>Fear, friendship, hallucinations that mingle with reality...</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2416370/extras/d1fb5da7c617d6e8f3edd40683ece1a1.avif?t=1685115569\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An intriguing story with charismatic characters.<br></li><li>Inimitable and everyone's favorite retro atmosphere.<br></li><li>Unusual audio solutions will make you experience unforgettable emotions.<br></li><li>Several unique endings.</li></ul><br><strong>Stay tuned and join our discord channel!</strong><br><br>",
